# Frontend Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# VITE_API_URL — Only set this in PRODUCTION (e.g., Vercel env vars).
#   In development, leave it empty/unset. Vite's dev-server proxy (/api → backend)
#   handles all API routing automatically via vite.config.js.
#
# Example for production:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#
# DO NOT set VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5001 here — it bypasses the Vite proxy
# and causes intermittent "Cannot connect to server" errors.
